{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_title", "source_sha256": "97394dd1d5a5952eac44cace98ca3a2bc6049507f761b7a5888b00a486d938aa", "ja": "パッションはそのままで", "zh": "保持这份热情不变", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f58c87ac59238ed5d857097cb42542666d498263054450805d8f122b3d91f88e", "ja": "ツアーについての雑誌取材で、熱い意気込み\nを語ったメンバー達は、本番が待ちきれず、\n劇場に戻ってレッスンをする事に。冷める事\nのないみんなの熱気を感じたプロデューサー\nは、期待に胸を膨らませる。", "zh": "在关于巡演的杂志采访中，成员们热情洋溢地\n谈起了自己的干劲，迫不及待地想迎来正式演出，\n于是决定返回剧场进行练习。感受到大家始终\n高涨的热情，制作人满怀期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1000_p", "source_sha256": "42776a6e42a646c302c1a630a474fbe1ea5cd6cd69eb4504a36cbd836b101722", "ja": "（ツアーを主題にした、雑誌の取材が入った。\n受け答えから、みんなの熱意が伝わってくる……！）", "zh": "（接受了以巡演为主题的杂志采访。从大家的回答中，能感受到他们的热情……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1001_interviewer", "source_sha256": "9a217d418eec95e06418a19e47e1bc96ebe3ecacbbdb2da1b0f52ad821695a34", "ja": "……それでは、最後に。ツアーに向けて、\nみなさんの意気込みを聞かせてください！", "zh": "……那么在最后，面向即将到来的巡演，\n请大家来谈谈各自的干劲吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "3a19b7fbf7b524e17f5cd1f75b8e2ddc1f5da29ab310216f9d45b9cda43f8299", "ja": "はい！　私たちらしい、熱くてアダルティなステージに\nしてみせます。見逃しちゃ、ダ・メ・よ？　ウフフ♪", "zh": "是！我们一定会打造出属于我们的、热情又成熟的舞台。可不能错过哦？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "3abbe1cd10047b266ccc5e5a00f26d0a1e9654bb8cc4915dbba13744c390a2b7", "ja": "昼を司る公演らしく、ギラギラと輝く\n私たちの『今』を、目に焼き付けていただければと。", "zh": "作为主宰白昼的演出，希望您能将我们闪耀夺目的『当下』，深深烙印在眼底。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "77918d99327765cff03cb2d6c370ca2e93b5c6841f818085ba448eb3e072cc10", "ja": "イエーイ☆　とっても楽しくて、特別なステージに\nしちゃいます！　絶対に後悔させないよ～！", "zh": "耶——☆ 我会把它变成一个超级开心又特别的舞台！绝对不会让你后悔哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "3aa569a158d56077a5bf871ef92bba62a597b6d898a36e733a6a51840a5e689e", "ja": "みんなみんなみーんな、ウズウズして踊り出したく\nなっちゃうような……そんな公演にするからネ！", "zh": "让大家每一个人都心痒难耐、忍不住想跳起舞来……我要把这场演出办成那样哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1006_interviewer", "source_sha256": "46a3990c031048dde60c5872c80c8350f6c2a3b9bae0225d8f3ad144280f5a47", "ja": "……はい、ありがとうございました！\nそれでは引き続き撮影の方、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "……好的，谢谢您！\n那么接下来也请继续协助拍摄！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "b920400ee6a4a2cd3286e166eee717e1cd308ce46ece2746e8449fc35a7dedf5", "ja": "お願いします！", "zh": "拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "b920400ee6a4a2cd3286e166eee717e1cd308ce46ece2746e8449fc35a7dedf5", "ja": "お願いします！", "zh": "拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "b920400ee6a4a2cd3286e166eee717e1cd308ce46ece2746e8449fc35a7dedf5", "ja": "お願いします！", "zh": "拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "b920400ee6a4a2cd3286e166eee717e1cd308ce46ece2746e8449fc35a7dedf5", "ja": "お願いします！", "zh": "拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1012_p", "source_sha256": "55f06be64cf9c686dc32947a834499e373cc570fdd1245d7cbb9f47ee9f47e3d", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。いいインタビューだったぞ！", "zh": "大家辛苦了。刚才的采访很棒哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "191776492b3457c1a577f2c93710ae4c47dc0717547f13d467883d3fd9bc05c6", "ja": "杏奈、ビビッと、全力出せました……。\nツアーの宣伝、しっかりできてたら、いいな……♪", "zh": "杏奈，能够直觉全开、拼尽全力……。\n要是能好好宣传这次巡演，就好了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1014_p", "source_sha256": "86296b5a2c247f4bd584851426d245b70f1c53efa26df18ec89b938d4350c24e", "ja": "ああ。他のメンバーも盛り上げてくれているし、\nきっとたくさんの人が来てくれると思う！", "zh": "啊。其他成员也在帮忙炒热气氛，\n我想一定会有很多人来捧场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "c4157103fc6d76bfd1a304e05860656b98f78675d927d3248e4db51c853ad5e3", "ja": "本当に楽しみです。待ちきれないくらい……\nって私、なんだか子どもっぽいですね。ふふっ。", "zh": "我真的很期待。甚至都有些等不及了……\n这样说的我，好像有点孩子气呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "451ceef6b889c4d0a45c3fdb3fc744358f4b307544d4ffb3528d61c73728db8a", "ja": "チハヤの気持ち、わかるヨ～！\nワタシも今すぐ踊りたくて、ウズウズしてるノ！", "zh": "千早的心情，我懂哦～！\n我也想现在就跳舞，已经跃跃欲试啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "83fd3881923556f15859e2fb840cfa35c8f402e519401fc51e763d7147e88b51", "ja": "それなら……今から劇場に戻って、\nレッスンしちゃう？　私はまだまだ余裕あるわよ♪", "zh": "既然这样……现在就回剧场，\n去练习一下？我还有的是精力呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1018_p", "source_sha256": "5e733b7ccee6016cb2aaa78c212eea055ae45edd612010063b796109fbee2bf2", "ja": "えっ、今からですか？\nまあ、レッスンルームはさすがに空いてますけど……。", "zh": "咦，现在就要去吗？\n不过，练习室倒是确实空着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "7bb1db135d2516b085aeef6f850b70bb960868bcfc574365c1fc64b0aae45c3a", "ja": "ホント！？　ヤッター！\n{$P$}、すぐ予約入れておいてネ！", "zh": "真的！？太好了！\n{$P$}，记得马上预约哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a98d2f6adc1a2abbbc9947b746964d50ea2e556ad196746488a06a7d6f69dd46", "ja": "ああ、でも……くれぐれも、無理はしないでくれよ。\nみんな、公演前の大事な時期なんだから。", "zh": "啊，不过……千万别勉强自己。\n大家现在可是演出前的重要时期。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "2bee0c7cb976a4f884f265b2ed4398dbab9e507cec0b38429b93ec19e64fda96", "ja": "ふふっ、わかってますよ。じゃ、行きましょう！", "zh": "呵呵，我知道啦。那么，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0263_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0263_story_08_1022_p", "source_sha256": "446d144adfcc215ae08b8c3847e7931a763504075122b65cf8e5a201921daf12", "ja": "（この公演準備期間中、みんなの熱気は本当に、\n一度も冷めることがなかった……本番が楽しみだな！）", "zh": "在这次演出的准备期间，大家的热情真的一次都没有冷却过……真期待正式演出啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
